{
  "_doc": "The markers of the Rig step (src/engine/markers.ts): a few points placed on one flat view of the model, from which every joint follows. Per body type: the view (front: the model seen from +Z, its right on the left; side: from +X, its head on the left), and its markers: a joint each ({Side} Left/Right, {s} l/r for a pair), or a point of its own tied to joints (attach). A pair on a front view is placed on both sides; on a side view on the near side (its left) and mirrored. mid: on the body's middle line. view hand: placed on a flat view of each hand (its back, along the fingers), not the body's.",
